OL,3,APolice arrest 36 in raids on Vietnamese
OL,4,Acrime gangs linked to human trafficking
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Scotland's biggest police
OL,7,Foperations has targeted a Vietnamese
OL,8,Forganised crime group linked to human
OL,9,Ftrafficking and cannabis farms.
OL,11,FAbout 300 officers took part in
OL,12,Fsimultaneous early-morning raids,
OL,13,Fleading to the arrest of 36 people and
OL,14,Fthe discovery of 14 cannabis-growing
OL,15,Foperations.
OL,17,FIn total, police searched or checked 47
OL,18,Faddresses in Aberdeen, Dundee, Falkirk,
OL,19,FEdinburgh, Glasgow, Ayrshire,
OL,20,FLanarkshire, Midlothian and the
OL,21,FScottish Borders.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
