OL,3,APolice arrest 36 in raids on Vietnamese
OL,4,Acrime gangs linked to human trafficking
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland allege the gang is
OL,7,Finvolved in "poly-criminality,"
OL,8,Fincluding human trafficking, drug
OL,9,Fproduction, fraud, money laundering and
OL,10,Forganised immigration crime.
